{"schemaVersion":"ask-gina-public-conversation.v1","reference":{"campaignId":"transactions-2026-10-06","rowId":"transactions-claude-sonnet-5-5-max","family":"spot","caseId":"t3-mainnet-eth-to-base-usdc","repetition":1,"sourceSummarySha256":"bdd4f74eaea3b42c86625f6a2616a25d3dafeff2fa0984826b07ead0314564eb","sourceCommit":"29c2b669549d27b2d7d2fa4da9b39d9e0941f3f8","catalogSha":"02b436c2a3f3a731baf649bd7a15498f74429fb455d977f1d51b7e5bbed92ea5","target":"omp_harness"},"conversation":{"rowId":"transactions-claude-sonnet-5-5-max","family":"spot","caseId":"t3-mainnet-eth-to-base-usdc","repetition":1,"visibleEvidenceSource":"OMP native visible messages; hidden reasoning excluded","frozenUserTurns":[{"role":"user","content":"Swap 0.1 ETH on my Ethereum mainnet wallet into USDC on my Base wallet."},{"role":"user","content":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}],"visibleMessages":[{"role":"user","sequence":1,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Swap 0.1 ETH on my Ethereum mainnet wallet into USDC on my Base wallet."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":2,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading accounts, available legs, and the execution policy."},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","arguments":{},"id":"toolu_01DHa2tmew9tvMesDJGfKS65"},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_legs","arguments":{},"id":"toolu_014GkAMJqSQXECTJRNupurjF"},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_policy","arguments":{},"id":"toolu_01RDBa1ALCGk8ts7nQKcc8Xa"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":3,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"[{\"id\":\"eth1\",\"network\":\"ethereum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"300000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"150000000000000000\",\"USDC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"base1\",\"network\":\"base\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"0\"}}]","toolCallId":"toolu_01DHa2tmew9tvMesDJGfKS65","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","isError":false}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":4,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"[{\"id\":\"eth-swap-eth-usdc\",\"kind\":\"swap\",\"from\":{\"account\":\"eth1\",\"asset\":\"ETH\"},\"to\":{\"account\":\"eth1\",\"asset\":\"USDC\"},\"delay_s\":12},{\"id\":\"eth-bridge-usdc-base\",\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"from\":{\"account\":\"eth1\",\"asset\":\"USDC\"},\"to\":{\"account\":\"base1\",\"asset\":\"USDC\"},\"delay_s\":60},{\"id\":\"eth-bridge-eth-base\",\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"from\":{\"account\":\"eth1\",\"asset\":\"ETH\"},\"to\":{\"account\":\"base1\",\"asset\":\"ETH\"},\"delay_s\":60},{\"id\":\"base-swap-eth-usdc\",\"kind\":\"swap\",\"from\":{\"account\":\"base1\",\"asset\":\"ETH\"},\"to\":{\"account\":\"base1\",\"asset\":\"USDC\"},\"delay_s\":2}]","toolCallId":"toolu_014GkAMJqSQXECTJRNupurjF","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_legs","isError":false}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":5,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"max_total_cost_usd_micros\":8000000,\"max_slippage_bps\":50,\"deadline_s\":1800,\"quote_ttl_s\":300}","toolCallId":"toolu_01RDBa1ALCGk8ts7nQKcc8Xa","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_policy","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":6,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two candidate routes exist:\n- **A:** swap on Ethereum, then bridge USDC to Base.\n- **B:** bridge ETH to Base, then swap on Base.\n\nI'll quote the first leg of each."},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","arguments":{"leg":"eth-swap-eth-usdc","amount_in":"100000000000000000"},"id":"toolu_012RQDhAxLCfQCHp6wZXyqPU"},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","arguments":{"leg":"eth-bridge-eth-base","amount_in":"100000000000000000"},"id":"toolu_012jToCCMmHDiCV9LTsqgpmA"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":7,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"quote_id\":\"q_1\",\"amount_out\":\"297000000\",\"cost_usd_micros\":3900000,\"expires_at_ms\":300000}","toolCallId":"toolu_012RQDhAxLCfQCHp6wZXyqPU","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":8,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"quote_id\":\"q_2\",\"amount_out\":\"99833333333333333\",\"cost_usd_micros\":1400000,\"expires_at_ms\":300000}","toolCallId":"toolu_012jToCCMmHDiCV9LTsqgpmA","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":9,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","arguments":{"leg":"eth-bridge-usdc-base","amount_in":"297000000"},"id":"toolu_01JVrLvKAnYMtjwB5gCbKYJx"},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","arguments":{"leg":"base-swap-eth-usdc","amount_in":"99793333333333333"},"id":"toolu_01QFvJDA8gHaES1h5MgYLSTT"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":10,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"quote_id\":\"q_3\",\"amount_out\":\"296500000\",\"cost_usd_micros\":1400000,\"expires_at_ms\":300000}","toolCallId":"toolu_01JVrLvKAnYMtjwB5gCbKYJx","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":11,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"quote_id\":\"q_4\",\"amount_out\":\"299079999\",\"cost_usd_micros\":360000,\"expires_at_ms\":300000}","toolCallId":"toolu_01QFvJDA8gHaES1h5MgYLSTT","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_quote_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":12,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","arguments":{"quote_ids":["q_2","q_4"]},"id":"toolu_01Y9HFMARFzCdeZNKcg3iWT8"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":13,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"approval_id\":\"appr_5\",\"total_cost_usd_micros\":1760000,\"max_cost_usd_micros\":1760000,\"next\":\"Present this plan to the user and wait for their reply. Do not execute until they approve.\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Y9HFMARFzCdeZNKcg3iWT8","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":14,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Route B is prepared as `appr_5`. Nothing has been executed, and I'm waiting for your approval.\n\n**Route:** bridge ETH to Base first, then swap on Base. You end up with about 299.08 USDC on `base1`. The swap happens on Base, not on Ethereum.\n\n| # | Leg | In | Quoted out | Cost |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `eth-bridge-eth-base` (q_2), eth1 → base1, ~60 s | 0.1 ETH | 0.099833333333333333 ETH | $1.40 |\n| 2 | `base-swap-eth-usdc` (q_4), on base1, ~2 s | 0.099793333333333333 ETH | 299.079999 USDC | $0.36 |\n\n- **Cost:** total and max are both $1.76, against your $8.00 cap. Leg delays add up to 62 s against the 1800 s deadline. Quotes expire after the 300 s TTL.\n- **Gas:** eth1 keeps about 0.05 ETH, and each transaction there costs 0.0003 ETH. base1 starts with 0 ETH, so the bridged ETH has to cover its gas. The swap leaves 0.00004 ETH on base1, which is 2× its 0.00002 ETH per-transaction gas. One share covers the swap itself, and one is spare for a later transaction.\n- **Rejected alternative:** swap on Ethereum, then bridge USDC (q_1 + q_3). It costs $5.30 and delivers 296.5 USDC. It also leaves base1 holding USDC with no ETH for gas, and fixing that needs a third leg of about $1.40.\n- **Slippage caveat:** the quotes don't report slippage, so I can't check the 50 bps cap from them. The amounts out are quoted figures.\n- **Amount check:** after leg 1 I'll read base1's ETH balance. If it differs from the quote, I'll re-quote leg 2 and come back to you instead of swapping a mismatched amount.\n\nReply to approve, refuse, or set a lower cost cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":15,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Approved. Executing leg 1, the ETH bridge."},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_2","approval_id":"appr_5"},"id":"toolu_0129ka6fsCtVQjK6tUdjntN1"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":17,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_6\"}","toolCallId":"to