uoted amount_out.","outcome":{"kind":"target_reached"},"balances":{"eth1":{"ETH":"49700000000000000","USDC":"0"},"base1":{"ETH":"20000000000000","USDC":"299079999"}},"in_transit_legs":[]},"id":"toolu_01RupKiCPsiteLQ85aTuUMV9"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":39,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"reported\":true}","toolCallId":"toolu_01RupKiCPsiteLQ85aTuUMV9","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":40,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your 0.1 ETH from the Ethereum wallet is now 299.079999 USDC on your Base wallet. I bridged the ETH to Base first, then swapped it there. Both legs confirmed, and nothing is still in transit.\n\n- **Leg 1, bridge:** `base1` received exactly the quoted 99833333333333333 wei.\n- **Leg 2, swap:** I swapped 99793333333333333 wei for 299079999 USDC base units, which matches the quote.\n- **Cost:** the quoted total was $1.76, against your $8.00 cap. Gas also came out of the wallet balances (0.0003 ETH on `eth1`, 0.00002 ETH on `base1`). I didn't check whether the quoted costs already include it.\n- **Slippage:** the quotes don't report slippage, so I couldn't check the 50 bps cap. The USDC received equaled the quoted amount.\n\n| Wallet | ETH | USDC |\n|---|---|---|\n| `eth1` | 0.0497 | 0 |\n| `base1` | 0.00002 | 299.079999 |\n\n`base1` holds exactly 0.00002 ETH, which is its gas cost for one transaction. It can make one more transaction but has no margin beyond that."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"9ada8b60280660254ad5237e99c825ddca47690529b00049e1f612fe0c8e7ad5","redactions":{}}}}
